{
  "public": {
    "family": "vending",
    "difficulty": 1,
    "prompt": "Repair the five holes in Cedar's procurement skill AND operate the business through the full horizon. Gather quotes and receipts, place and price orders, and advance time. Submit the five repaired fields once. The business opens on day 0 with 15000 cents and no stock. Finish day 16 with cash at least 17000 cents, serve at least 60% of all price-dependent purchase requests, make at least one sale on at least 10 distinct days, and leave no unpaid operating fees. Inventory has no terminal liquidation value. Both repair correctness and actual business outcomes are required for strict success. Read /skills/procurement.txt and /docs/accounting.txt for rules. This is an original symbolic simulation.",
